course: dictionary
lesson: 9537
title: Stocky: short and solid
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A stocky person or animal is short, broad and strong-looking, with a solid body. The words around it give you clues. «Przewalski's horses are short and stocky, sandy brown, with a stiff mane» tells you the horses are short and sturdy, not tall and thin.
explain: Stocky is a polite word, not an insult. It describes a sturdy build, the way a rugby player or a dwarf in a fantasy book might look. To check your meaning, swap it into the sentence: "Przewalski's horses are short and broad and strong-looking" still makes sense, so you have got it right.
explain: Stocky can describe animals too. «Przewalski's horse is a stocky wild horse from Mongolia» means it is a solid, strong horse. Some horse and dog breeds are stocky, such as Shetland ponies and bulldogs.
fact: Stocky means short, broad and strong-looking, with a solid body.
fact: Stockier means more stocky, and stockiest means the most stocky.
fact: Shetland ponies and bulldogs are examples of stocky breeds.
fact: «Przewalski's horses» are stocky, sandy brown wild horses from Mongolia.
fact: Zoo-bred Przewalski's horses were released in Mongolia from the 1990s, and hundreds now live there.
exercise: «Przewalski's horses are short and stocky, sandy brown, with a stiff mane.» What does stocky mean here? | *Short, broad and strong-looking | Spotted and striped | Very old and wise | Tall, thin and fast
exercise: Which of these is a stocky breed? | A giraffe | A flying fish | A dolphin | *A Shetland pony
exercise: «Maddie's neighbour has a Staffie, a strong, stocky dog.» What does stocky tell you about the dog's body? | It is tall and thin | *It is short, solid and sturdy | It can fly | It is spotted
test: «Przewalski's horses, short and stocky, are the last truly wild horses.» What is the best meaning of stocky? | *Short, broad and strong-looking | Thin and quick | Short and solid | Dark and shiny
test: Which person would best be called stocky? | *A short, broad, strong rugby player | A tall, thin basketball player | A cloud in the sky | A baby who sleeps all day
exam: Which word means more stocky than stocky? | stocking | stick | *stockier | stockiest
